cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this MCP server, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: GDACS Disasters MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server for global natural disaster and hazard monitoring via GDACS
  (Global Disaster Alert and Coordination System), a joint initiative of the
  UN and European Commission. It searches ongoing and recent events worldwide,
  covering earthquakes, floods, volcanoes, wildfires, droughts, cyclones, and
  tsunamis.
